1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,700
Every business begins with an idea.

2
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:08,860
But somewhere along the way… things get complicated.

3
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:38,940
It isn't the people. It's everything that doesn't connect.

4
00:00:50,400 --> 00:00:56,060
Different tools. Different files. Endless workarounds.

5
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:02,620
What if your business could simply show the system how it works?

6
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:15,500
It listens to what you say, and looks at what you show.

7
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:22,260
Don't change the way your business works…
Build the software around it.

8
00:01:26,900 --> 00:01:35,760
Then it lays out what it understood: what you keep track of,
how work moves along, and the rules you follow. Each with the moment you said it.

9
00:01:35,900 --> 00:01:41,480
You keep what's right, and leave out what isn't.
Nothing goes live without your OK.

10
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:47,500
One click, and your app is ready.
Open it, share the link, or download everything.

11
00:01:55,000 --> 00:02:02,020
And your rules actually hold. Try to lend the same drill twice,
and the system says no, and tells you why.

12
00:02:05,900 --> 00:02:14,120
When something changes, just say it in one sentence, or record again.
You approve every change.

13
00:02:14,600 --> 00:02:17,060
Call everything what your team calls it.

14
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:27,820
With Plus, it becomes your team's system: reports, calendar and webhook connections,
roles for every colleague, and invoices straight from a record.

15
00:02:31,500 --> 00:02:36,760
Build more apps as you grow.
And real people at Integrint help you along the way.

16
00:02:43,900 --> 00:02:47,800
Same company. Same people. Finally connected.

17
00:02:54,800 --> 00:02:58,780
Code Your Reality. Your processes. Your software.
